+    config's training block IS the protocol: pairing a vanilla config with an
+    fa-trained checkpoint must raise, pointing at the two remedies it has (fix
+    the config, or use eval_FLAC's override) and never at an override of its own."""
+    with pytest.raises(ValueError) as exc:
