   370	class _RecordingConditioner:
   371	    """Minimal stand-in for ``MultiConditioner``: records every call and returns
   372	    a conditioning dict carrying one ViT id, so ``fa_invariant`` actually runs
   373	    its C4 frame-average loop (base pass + one pass per non-identity angle)."""
