    58	    """Write the toy model config, dataset config and checkpoint; return their paths.
    59	
    60	    ``config_training`` extends the ``--model-config`` training block (the
    61	    fallback authority); ``ckpt_extra`` extends the checkpoint dict (pass
    62	    :func:`_embedded` to make it a training checkpoint rather than a bare one).
