      trained protocol; an explicit contradicting value raises a ValueError naming
      both protocols and the source, unless --allow-conditioning-override (loud
      warning); the guard runs after torch.load, before model construction; orbit
      comparison treats reordering as a mismatch; metrics record + predictions
      meta gain trained_cond_method, trained_frame_avg_angles, cond_method_source
