    25	    """Construct the metrics-JSON and predictions-.pt output paths for one run.
    26	
    27	    Pure (no filesystem access): both paths sit in ``ckpt_path``'s directory,
    28	    named ``<ckpt>_<kind>_<steps>_<cfg>_<eval_name><method><rot>.<ext>``.
    29	
    30	    The vanilla + ``rotate_deg == 0`` name is byte-identical to the legacy
    31	    ``eval_FLAC`` output, so exp_01 / exp_02 artifacts reproduce exactly. A
    32	    non-vanilla ``cond_method`` inserts ``_<cond_method>_a<n_angles>`` and a
    33	    non-zero ``rotate_deg`` appends ``_rot<int(rotate_deg)>``. Both suffixes now
    34	    also land on the predictions name -- fixing the exp_02 bug where two
    35	    ``rotate_deg`` values sharing an ``eval_name`` overwrote one predictions file.
    36	
    37	    Returns
